`benchmark.meta description: Fills a buffered channel with a backlog, then drains it.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: compile-timing

/core/channel

. count = 30000
. channel SyncBufferedChannel'Int
for i in 0 .. < count
    channel <- i

. checksum = 0
for i in 0 .. < count
    checksum += (<- channel)!

-- "bench-result tasks/buffered-drain checksum=$checksum"
